        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 955SQ, Clear Glass with Square Rose Knobset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <a href=\"/collections/omnia-prodigy-collection\"><b>Omnia Prodigy</b></a>  collections Classic Beauty Clear Glass Door Knob has a sparkling, elegant, historic design and is combined with current style square rose back plate. It has enough detail to make it a lovely point of interest without being gaudy. The Omnia 955SQ is available in your choice of 8 finish colors.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Clear Glass Square Rose Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n<li>55° rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Covers Standard 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-installation.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 955SQ Clear Glass Square Rose Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose: 2-9/16\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, privacy button, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Clear Glass Square Rose Knobset, Omnia 955SQ",
                "description": "The Omnia Prodigy collections Classic Beauty Clear Glass Door Knob has a sparkling, elegant, historic design and is combined with current style square rose back plate. It has enough detail to make it a lovely point of interest without being gaudy. The Omnia 955SQ is available in your choice of 8 finish colors.  ",
